        <profile id="6fcce2dd-7a4b-5a42-8589-95796ad81d15" name="Assault Ram" hidden="false" typeId="3ec9b61c-f3d1-5fe4-adb4-6104872812e1" typeName="Ability">
         <characteristics>
          <characteristic name="Description" typeId="5e1f6242-764b-516f-9c81-5659b132c092">Carries 4 Crew of boarders rather than 1. Its magna-melta bore opens the hull directly: boarders it delivers ignore the −1 for a Hull Assault and land as though delivered by craft. Armour 10 and it may not be intercepted by Defence Batteries on the round it strikes.</characteristic>
