          <characteristic name="Description" typeId="5e1f6242-764b-516f-9c81-5659b132c092">Character. Endure: Once per battle round, this ship may ignore one negative modifier caused by Crew loss or by being Crippled.</characteristic>
         </characteristics>
        </profile>
